version: 1.10.0
date-released: 2026-10-27
license: MIT
url: "https://github.com/creelie/eLhmr/releases/tag/v1.10.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/creelie/eLhmr"
abstract: >-
  A sixteen-prime-factor lower bound and exact completion criteria for
  Lehmer's totient problem. The full conjecture remains unproved.
  The current revision proves that every composite solution exceeds 10^35,
  that a quotient of at least 3 forces at least 18001 prime factors and
  that 3 | n forces more than 10^9.

doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23684663"
